      "heading": "Workspace Risk Configurations",
      "id": "risk-configurations",
      "intro": "Tab **Risk Configurations** adalah workspace untuk mengelola konfigurasi risiko perangkat. Setiap konfigurasi memiliki Flag Name (label klasifikasi risiko), Risk Score (0–100), Description, dan status Active/Inactive. Pilih konfigurasi dari list kiri, ubah nilai di panel kanan, lalu klik Update.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "List Panel: Memilih Risk Configuration",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **List Panel (lebar 280px)** di sisi kiri workspace menampilkan semua risk configuration yang tersedia.\n• Setiap item ditampilkan dengan **accent strip berwarna** di kiri sesuai level risiko:\n  - Score ≥ 80 → Merah (HIGH)\n  - Score ≥ 50 → Orange (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n  - Score ≥ 20 → Kuning (MEDIUM)\n  - Score < 20 → Biru (LOW)\n• **Flag Name** ditampilkan dalam huruf kapital (uppercase).\n• Item yang sedang **dipilih/aktif** ditandai dengan border mainColor, background subtle, dan ikon chevron di kanan.\n• Di bagian bawah list panel, tampil **Total** jumlah konfigurasi.",
          "color": "#4f46e5",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(79,70,229,.1);border:1px solid #e0e7ff;background:#fff;width:200px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Risk configurations</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:1px;\">Device intelligence risk settings</div></div><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#ede9fe;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4f46e5\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M22 3H2l8 9.46V19l4 2v-8.54L22 3z\"/></svg></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;\"><div style=\"border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #4f46e5;background:rgba(79,70,229,.06);display:flex;\"><div style=\"width:4px;background:#ef4444;\"></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Flag Name</div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:900;color:#dc2626;margin-top:3px;text-transform:uppercase;\">HIGH_RISK</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 8px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4f46e5\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M9 18l6-6-6-6\"/></svg></div></div><div style=\"border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;\"><div style=\"width:4px;background:#d9e1ea;\"></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Flag Name</div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin-top:3px;text-transform:uppercase;\">MEDIUM_RISK</div></div></div><div style=\"border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;\"><div style=\"width:4px;background:#d9e1ea;\"></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Flag Name</div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin-top:3px;text-transform:uppercase;\">LOW_RISK</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#94a3b8;\">Total</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">3</span></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Edit Panel: Mengubah Risk Configuration",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:2}\n• **Edit Panel** di kanan workspace menampilkan form \"General settings\" untuk konfigurasi terpilih.\n• **Flag Name** (read-only): Identifier label risiko seperti `HIGH_RISK`, `MEDIUM_RISK`, `LOW_RISK`. Tidak dapat diubah langsung dari UI.\n• **Risk Score** (editable): Input numerik 0–100. Skor menentukan level risiko:\n  - 80–100 → Merah (sangat tinggi)\n  - 50–79 → Orange (tinggi)\n  - 20–49 → Kuning (sedang)\n  - 0–19 → Biru (rendah)\n• **Description** (read-only): Penjelasan tentang konfigurasi risiko ini. Tidak dapat diubah dari UI.\n• **Rule Status** (editable): Toggle Switch untuk mengaktifkan/menonaktifkan konfigurasi, disertai Badge status (Active/Inactive).\n• **Tombol Cancel**: Muncul dan dapat diklik jika ada perubahan — reset form ke nilai semula.\n• **Tombol Update**: Submit perubahan ke server. Disabled jika tidak ada perubahan atau form tidak valid.",
          "color": "#4f46e5",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "2": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(79,70,229,.1);border:1px solid #e0e7ff;background:#fff;max-width:380px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">General settings</div><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Configure device risk parameters for intelligent monitoring.</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:5px;\"><button style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#4f46e5;border:none;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M19 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11l5 5v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"/><polyline points=\"17 21 17 13 7 13 7 21\"/></svg>Update</button></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:8px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;align-items:start;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Flag Name</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:2px;\">Risk category label.</div></div><input value=\"HIGH_RISK\" readOnly style=\"padding:5px 9px;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:6px;font-size:9.5px;color:#6b7280;background:#f9fafb;cursor:not-allowed;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\"/></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:8px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;align-items:start;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Risk Score</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:2px;\">Numerical risk score (0–100).</div></div><input value=\"85\" style=\"padding:5px 9px;border:1.5px solid #4f46e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:9.5px;color:#0f172a;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\"/></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:8px;padding:10px 0;align-items:start;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Rule status</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:2px;\">Enable or disable configuration.</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div style=\"width:32px;height:18px;border-radius:12px;background:#4f46e5;position:relative;\"><div style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;position:absolute;top:2px;right:2px;\"></div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#dcfce7;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">Active</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
